    <tags>devpocket freeport adbshot zipper cli dev-tools windows</tags>
    <summary>A growing collection of small, single-purpose dev tools: freeport, adbshot, zipper.</summary>
    <description>
DevPocket is a growing collection of small, single-purpose dev tools:

- **freeport** - frees a TCP port by killing whatever process is listening on it.
- **adbshot** - captures a screenshot from a connected ADB (Android) device straight to the clipboard.
- **zipper** - zips a folder while skipping junk like node_modules, bin, dist.

Installing this package puts `freeport`, `adbshot`, and `zipper` on your PATH.

See the project README for full usage: https://github.com/iAhtasham/DevPocket
    </description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
